    category: "Linux",
    title: "多發行版安全更新公告：AlmaLinux、Debian、Mageia、Oracle、Red Hat 與 SUSE 針對多個核心元件發布修補程式",
    summary: "多數主流 Linux 發行版（包括 AlmaLinux、Debian、Mageia、Oracle、Red Hat 和 SUSE）近期發布了大規模的安全更新。這些更新涵蓋了從核心元件到應用層的廣泛範圍，受影響的元件包括 libpng、libxml2、python3.14、postgresql-13、Nginx、MySQL、OpenSSL、Kubernetes 相關組件（如 apptainer, kubevirt1）以及各種開發庫。發行版針對不同產品線進行了獨立修補，例如 Oracle 更新了 .NET 10.0、.NET 8.0、.NET 9.0 等多個版本；SUSE 更新了 mbedtls、openssl-1_1 和 webkit2gtk3 等關鍵函式庫。實務上，系統管理員應立即檢查並更新所有受影響的發行版和元件，以修補潛在的漏洞，確保系統的穩定性和安全性。由於原文僅列出更新的元件，未提供具體的 CVE 編號或 CVSS 分數，建議參考各發行版的官方安全公告進行詳細評估。",
    tags: ["Linux", "AlmaLinux", "Debian", "Red Hat", "SUSE", "安全更新", "核心元件", "CVE"],
    title_en: "Multi-Distribution Security Update Announcement: AlmaLinux, Debian, Mageia, Oracle, Red Hat, and SUSE Release Patches for Multiple Core Components",
    summary_en: "Most major Linux distributions (including AlmaLinux, Debian, Mageia, Oracle, Red Hat, and SUSE) recently released large-scale security updates. These updates cover a wide range of components, from core libraries to application layers. Affected components include libpng, libxml2, python3.14, postgresql-13, Nginx, MySQL, OpenSSL, and Kubernetes-related components (such as apptainer, kubevirt1), as well as various development libraries. The distributions have applied independent patches for different product lines; for example, Oracle updated multiple versions such as .NET 10.0, .NET 8.0, and .NET 9.0; and SUSE updated key libraries like mbedtls, openssl-1_1, and webkit2gtk3. In practice, system administrators should immediately check and update all affected distributions and components to patch potential vulnerabilities, ensuring system stability and security. Since the original text only lists the updated components and does not provide specific CVE IDs or CVSS scores, it is recommended to refer to the official security announcements of each distribution for a detailed assessment.",
    tags_en: ["Linux", "AlmaLinux", "Debian", "Red Hat", "SUSE", "Security Update", "Core Components", "CVE"],
    sources: [
      { name: "LWN.net", url: "https://lwn.net/Articles/1079551", lang: "EN" }
    ]
