    id: "20260625-049",
    trackers: ["security"],
    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "Yokogawa FAST/TOOLS 與 CI Server 存在資訊傳輸明文漏洞，CVSS 評分高達 8.2",
    summary: "Yokogawa 的 FAST/TOOLS 和 Collaborative Information Server (CI Server) 產品系列存在一個名為 CVE-2026-11833 的安全漏洞。此漏洞屬於「敏感資訊明文傳輸」（CWE-319），可能允許攻擊者透過網路伺服器回應，竊取包含 CI Server 設定資訊的敏感資料。該漏洞影響的產品版本包括 FAST/TOOLS >=R9.01 到 <=R10.04，以及 CI Server >=R1.01 到 <=R1.04。該漏洞的 CVSS 3.1 分數為 7.5，CVSS 4.0 分數為 8.2，均被評定為高風險（HIGH）。Yokogawa 建議用戶將 FAST/TOOLS 更新至 R10.04 並套用補丁軟體 (R10.04 SP4)，並建議將 CI Server 更新至 R1.05。此外，CISA 亦提醒用戶應將控制系統網路隔離，並透過防火牆保護，以最小化網路暴露風險。",
    tags: ["Yokogawa", "CVE-2026-11833", "FAST/TOOLS", "CI Server", "OT/ICS", "明文傳輸"],
    title_en: "Yokogawa FAST/TOOLS and CI Server contain plaintext transmission vulnerability, CVSS score up to 8.2",
    summary_en: "A security vulnerability, designated CVE-2026-11833, exists in Yokogawa's FAST/TOOLS and Collaborative Information Server (CI Server) product lines. This vulnerability is classified as \"Sensitive Information Plaintext Transmission\" (CWE-319) and could potentially allow an attacker to steal sensitive data, including CI Server configuration information, through a network server response. Affected product versions include FAST/TOOLS >=R9.01 to <=R10.04, and CI Server >=R1.01 to <=R1.04. The vulnerability has a CVSS 3.1 score of 7.5 and a CVSS 4.0 score of 8.2, both rated as HIGH risk. Yokogawa recommends that users update FAST/TOOLS to R10.04 and apply the patch software (R10.04 SP4), and recommends updating CI Server to R1.05. Furthermore, CISA also advises users to isolate the control system network and protect it using firewalls to minimize network exposure risk.",
    tags_en: ["Yokogawa", "CVE-2026-11833", "FAST/TOOLS", "CI Server", "OT/ICS", "Plaintext Transmission"],
    sources: [
      { name: "CISA KEV Catalog", url: "https://cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-176-01", lang: "EN" }
    ]
