    title: "Robinhood重構存取權限流程：導入SERA平台，加速高頻開發與事件響應",
    summary: "金融科技公司Robinhood為解決傳統系統存取權限審批流程過於僵化，導致開發和事件響應效率低下的問題，主動進行了工程重構。原流程要求所有存取權限必須在公司管理設備上進行審批，這不符合Robinhood作為全球24/7營運的現代化、移動式企業的需求，尤其在關鍵事件或跨時區開發時，審批延遲會成為重大瓶頸。為此，應用安全團隊開發了「安全增強遠端審批」（Secure Enhanced Remote Approval, SERA）平台。SERA能夠從任何設備執行基於Passkey的存取審批，大幅降低了審批摩擦。實施後，SERA成功將開發人員和事件響應人員的審批時間縮短了20%。這項工程展示了如何透過安全工程手段，在不犧牲安全性的前提下，為高頻率開發和AI輔助工程奠定基礎。",
    tags: ["Robinhood", "SERA", "Passkey", "應用安全", "身份存取管理", "高頻開發"],
    title_en: "Robinhood Restructures Access Control Workflow: Adopting SERA Platform to Accelerate High-Frequency Development and Incident Response",
    summary_en: "To address the rigidity of traditional system access control approval processes, which hindered development and incident response efficiency, the fintech company Robinhood proactively undertook an engineering overhaul. The original process required all access permissions to be approved on company-managed devices, which did not align with the needs of a modern, mobile, 24/7 global enterprise like Robinhood. Specifically, approval delays became a major bottleneck during critical incidents or cross-timezone development. Consequently, the application security team developed the \"Secure Enhanced Remote Approval\" (SERA) platform. SERA enables Passkey-based access approval from any device, significantly reducing approval friction. After implementation, SERA successfully reduced the approval time for both developers and incident responders by 20%. This engineering effort demonstrates how security engineering can lay the groundwork for high-frequency development and AI-assisted engineering without compromising security.",
    tags_en: ["Robinhood", "SERA", "Passkey", "Application Security", "Identity Access Management", "High-Frequency Development"],
